WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:00.750
llama.

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:06.190
cpp makes local large language model inference practical across a wide range of hardware.

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.853
It can support personal experimentation, homelab systems, private assistants, local web UIs,

00:00:10.853 --> 00:00:12.407
and small inference services.

00:00:12.407 --> 00:00:15.127
Its value comes from control and portability,

00:00:15.127 --> 00:00:19.790
but that control brings responsibility for model choice, runtime settings, prompt formatting,

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.344
performance, privacy, and exposure.

00:00:21.344 --> 00:00:26.396
Strong practice starts with appropriate GGUF files and a clear understanding of quantization.

00:00:26.396 --> 00:00:30.670
Choose models that match the task, hardware, context needs, licensing requirements,

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:31.836
and expected quality.

00:00:31.836 --> 00:00:35.333
Validate tokenizer and chat template behavior before judging output.

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:39.219
Document the runtime version, model source, command settings, acceleration path,

00:00:39.219 --> 00:00:40.384
and performance results.

00:00:40.384 --> 00:00:41.161
Serving llama.

00:00:41.161 --> 00:00:45.436
cpp over an API can make local inference available to applications,

00:00:45.436 --> 00:00:47.379
but it should be controlled.

00:00:47.379 --> 00:00:50.487
Use local-only binding by default for private experiments,

00:00:50.487 --> 00:00:53.596
think carefully before allowing LAN or remote access,

00:00:53.596 --> 00:00:56.316
and treat prompts and outputs as sensitive.

00:00:56.316 --> 00:01:00.979
The moment a model becomes a service, access control, logging, retention, monitoring,

00:01:00.979 --> 00:01:02.144
and reliability matter.

00:01:02.144 --> 00:01:06.419
The goal is not just to make a model answer once.

00:01:06.419 --> 00:01:11.081
The goal is to build a stable, private, understandable local inference workflow.

00:01:11.081 --> 00:01:15.356
When settings are repeatable, prompts are formatted correctly, performance is monitored,

00:01:15.356 --> 00:01:17.299
and exposure is controlled, llama.

00:01:17.299 --> 00:01:21.700
cpp becomes a practical foundation for learning and building with local AI.
